<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Modelo started as hold.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Modelo started as hold.</headline>
<text>
<p>Ing Barings said Wednesday it initiated coverage of Mexican brewer Grupo Modelo with a hold rating.</p>
<p>&quot;We believe that beer volumes can rebound by an estimated 5-6 percent in 1997. However, on our 1997-1998 earnings and EBITDA forecasts, we believe Modelo shares are fairly valued, &quot; analyst Marla Marron said.</p>
</text>
